IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `uc-core`
IMPORT `uc-core-persons`
IMPORT `uc4-seat`

-- Worked cases for the seat questions in uc4-seat.l4: one or more per question, expected values written by hand from the text.
-- Each case names every input it sets; the generator that wrote this file filled the others with FALSE, 0, NOTHING, EMPTY or a stated date.
--
-- Part 5 (regulations 38 to 44) and Schedules 6 to 9.

-- Q1. Descriptor 1(a) scores 15 from a bodily disease: limited capability for work (reg 39(3)(a)).
#ASSERT `Do I have limited capability for work on the points I score` TRUE TRUE FALSE (LIST `Sch 6 descriptor 1(a)`) EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS TRUE

-- Q1. 9 points for activity 1 and 6 for activity 2 reach 15 within Part 1 (reg 39(3)(a)).
