-- Q1. Without a specific disease or disablement the assessment is not one under this Part (reg 39(2)).
#ASSERT `Do I have limited capability for work on the points I score` FALSE TRUE FALSE (LIST `Sch 6 descriptor 1(a)`) EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS FALSE

