-- Q1. 9 points from Part 1 and 6 from Part 2 reach 15 by combination (reg 39(3)(c)).
#ASSERT `Do I have limited capability for work on the points I score` TRUE TRUE TRUE (LIST `Sch 6 descriptor 1(c)`) EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY (LIST `Sch 6 descriptor 11(c)`) EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS TRUE

-- Q1. With no mental cause, the Part 2 descriptor scores nothing and 9 points fall short (reg 39(4)(b)).
